[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "qg-declined-main 2...e6"]
[Name "3.Nf3: the same set-up"]

3. Nf3 { White develops the other knight first. }
3... Nf6 { The same move as against 3.Nc3. It develops and guards d5, and Black waits to see where White's pieces go. }
4. Nc3 { Back in the main lines: this is the 4.Nf3 position. } *
